# Keep the Docker build context lean + reproducible for the pnpm-workspace
# image builds (which use the repo root as context). Dependencies are installed
# inside the build from the committed pnpm-lock.yaml — never copy host
# node_modules or build output in.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/cdk.out
.git
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
# Go build caches / binaries (the router builds in its own stage)
**/*.test
